  "notes": [
    "5 variables have no DTCG type and are left out: Feature/On (BOOLEAN), Ease/Out (EASING), Ease/Curve (EASING), Ease/Spring (EASING), Duration (TIMING).",
    "Lost points at a variable that is neither in this file nor in a library it uses: left out.",
    "Ink points at Accent from a library (Library Colors): no file here defines it, so add that library's tokens for the reference to resolve.",
    "Veil (Dark) is a colour at an opacity whose colour cannot be resolved here: written as a reference to that colour, without its opacity.",
    "Veil (dark) is a colour at an opacity with a variable in it: DTCG cannot fade a reference, so it is written resolved.",
    "Lost (dark) holds no value DTCG can write as its type: left out.",
    "White has the same DTCG path as another token: written as White-2.",
    "Glow (paint), Photo (paint), Shadow/Card (effect), Frost (effect): no DTCG type for these styles, left out.",
    "Body: Auto line height, written as 1.2 (CSS's normal); give the style a line height in Figma to match exactly.",
    "Heading/H1, Body: fontWeight is guessed from the font style's name (Semi Bold 600, Bold 700), since a text style keeps no weight of its own; a variable font's real weight can differ.",
    "Heading/H1 (text-transform), Glow/Drawn (gradient angle): DTCG has no field for these, left out; format css writes them."
  ]
